      "message": "[warning] Line 60: 🟡 Installing `stable` via the rustup bootstrap script makes the CQFD image non-reproducible because the compiler version can change between image rebuilds. Pin a specific Rust toolchain version, and preferably verify the bootstrap script/checksum or install from a pinned artifact, so CI failures are not caused by an unexpected toolchain update.",
