      "message": "[error] Line 68: 🔴 `chmod -R a+rwX /usr/local/rustup /usr/local/cargo` makes every Rust binary on PATH world-writable, so any unprivileged process in the image can replace `cargo`/`rustc` and affect later builds. Keep these directories owned by root and grant write access only to the actual build user or a dedicated group, e.g. `chown -R \u003cbuild-user\u003e:\u003cbuild-user\u003e` or `chmod -R go-w` after installation.",
